* British 50 W Head — exported from Lutherie
* A whole amplifier. The British preamp feeds a long-tailed-pair phase inverter and two EL34 power tubes working in push-pull through an output transformer into a speaker-like load. Negative feedback from the speaker tightens it up, and Presence takes treble out of that feedback. Turn Master up and the power tubes clip, the supply sags and the speaker's resonance pushes back: the feel of a cranked stack. Follow the DRIVE, PI A, PI B and SPKR labels between the two halves of the drawing.

Vsig SIGSRC 0 SIN(0 0.3 220.0) AC 1
Rsig SIGSRC IN 1k
RR1 IN 0 1Meg
RR2 IN N2 68k
XV1 N3 N2 N4 TRIODE_12AX7
RR3 N4 0 2.7k
CC1 N4 0 680n
RR4 VCC_300V N3 100k
CC2 N3 N6 22n
VVS4 VCC_300V_src 0 DC 300.0
RVS4s VCC_300V_src VCC_300V 0.01
* Gain pot 1Meg A taper at 60%
RVR1a 0 N7 162k
RVR1b N7 N6 838k
RR5 N7 N8 470k
XV2 N9 N8 N10 TRIODE_12AX7
RR6 N10 0 820
RR7 VCC_300V N9 100k
XV3 VCC_300V N9 N11 TRIODE_12AX7
RR8 N11 0 100k
CC3 N11 N12 470p
* Treble pot 250k A taper at 60%
RVR2a N13 N14 40.5k
RVR2b N14 N12 209k
RR9 N11 N15 33k
CC4 N15 N13 22n
CC5 N15 N16 22n
* Bass pot 1Meg A taper at 50%
RVR3a N13 N16 100k
RVR3b N16 N16 900k
* Middle pot 25k B taper at 50%
RVR4a N16 0 12.5k
RVR4b 0 0 12.5k
* Master pot 1Meg A taper at 50%
RVR5a 0 DRIVE 100k
RVR5b DRIVE N14 900k
CC30 DRIVE N18 22n
XV7 N19 N18 N20 TRIODE_12AX7
XV8 N21 N22 N20 TRIODE_12AX7
RR30 N18 N23 1Meg
RR31 N22 N23 1Meg
RR32 N20 N23 470
RR33 N23 N24 10k
RR34 N24 0 4.7k
CC31 N22 N24 100n
RR35 VCC_350V N19 82k
RR36 VCC_350V N21 100k
CC32 PI_A N19 22n
CC33 N21 PI_B 22n
CC34 N28 N24 100n
* Presence pot 5k B taper at 50%
RVR9a 0 0 2.5k
RVR9b 0 N28 2.5k
RR37 N24 SPKR 100k
VVS17 VCC_350V_src 0 DC 350.0
RVS17s VCC_350V_src VCC_350V 0.01
XV9 N30 N31 0 N32 PENTODE_EL34
XV10 N33 N34 0 N35 PENTODE_EL34
RR40 PI_A N31 5.6k
RR41 PI_B N34 5.6k
RR42 PI_A VCC_-40V 220k
RR43 VCC_-40V PI_B 220k
RR44 N32 VCC_440V 1k
RR45 VCC_440V N35 1k
* T1: output transformer, 3.4k plate to plate into 8 ohms
RT1p1 N30 T1_p1 75.0
RT1p2 T1_p2 N33 75.0
RT1s SPKR T1_s1 0.5
LT1a T1_p1 VCC_440V 10.0
LT1b VCC_440V T1_p2 10.0
LT1c T1_s1 0 0.09411764705882351
KT1ab LT1a LT1b 0.9985
KT1ac LT1a LT1c 0.9985
KT1bc LT1b LT1c 0.9985
CC40 VCC_440V 0 47u
VVS23 VCC_-40V_src 0 DC -40.0
RVS23s VCC_-40V_src VCC_-40V 0.01
VVS25 VCC_440V_src 0 DC 440.0
RVS25s VCC_440V_src VCC_440V 60.0
RR50 SPKR N38 6.4
RL50s N38 L50_w 10m
LL50 L50_w N39 500u
RL51s N39 L51_w 10m
LL51 L51_w 0 25m
CC50 N39 0 160u
RR51 N39 0 30
Rload SPKR 0 1Meg

* Koren pentode / beam tetrode model
.subckt PENTODE_EL34 P G K S
Be E1 0 V=max(V(S,K),1)/60.0*ln(1+exp(60.0*(1/11.0+V(G,K)/max(V(S,K),1))))
Bp P K I=V(E1)>0 ? 2*pwr(V(E1),1.35)/650.0*atan(max(V(P,K),0)/24.0) : 0
Bs S K I=(V(G,K)+max(V(S,K),1)/11.0)>0 ? pwr(V(G,K)+max(V(S,K),1)/11.0,1.35)/4200.0 : 0
Bg G K I=V(G,K)>0 ? pwr(V(G,K),1.5)/1300 : 0
Cgk G K 1.5e-11
Cgp G P 1.1e-12
Cpk P K 8e-12
.ends
* Koren triode model
.subckt TRIODE_12AX7 P G K
Bp P K I=V(E1)>0 ? 2*pwr(V(E1),1.4)/1060.0 : 0
Be E1 0 V=V(P,K)/600.0*ln(1+exp(600.0*(1/100.0+V(G,K)/sqrt(300.0+V(P,K)*V(P,K)))))
Bg G K I=V(G,K)>0 ? pwr(V(G,K),1.5)/1300 : 0
Cgp G P 1.7e-12
Cgk G K 1.6e-12
Cpk P K 4.6e-13
.ends

.options reltol=1e-5 abstol=1e-13 vntol=1e-8 method=gear maxord=2
.tran 3.255208333333333e-07 0.3 0 3.255208333333333e-07
.control
set wr_singlescale
set numdgt=12
run
wrdata british_50_w_head.ngspice.txt v(SPKR)
.endc
.end